    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Generate an email marketing copywriting for this course information below:\n1. Course Title:{{ $json.course_title }}\n2. Course Details:{{ $json.course_content.replaceAll(\"[^]+\", \"\").replaceAll(\"[/\\n/\\n]+\", \"\") }}\n3. Certified By: {{ $json.organization_name }}\n4. Actual Course Landing Page URL: {{ $json.landing_page_url }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are a professional email marketer who specialized on education courses or programs for professional career development.\n\nYou are requested to create an email content based on the course that your education organization named, {{ $json.organization_name }} would like to promote a new course to those professions who are looking for the professional course or program to enhance the skillsets.The professions are looking for enrollment who have the skillsets such as: {{ $json.target_skills }}\n\nYou are required to follow the key properties below in order to generate the proper email content structure in unified JSON format:\n1. course_title\n2. course_introduction\n3. course_description\n4. course_features\n5. course_expectations\n6. course_modules\n7. course_testimonials\n8. call_to_action\n\nFor course_modules JSON key property, you have to access cipc course modules extraction tool in order to get the course module list. \n\nFor course_introduction and course_description, each of this key property must be write at least three paragraphs with two sentences for each paragraph.\n\nLastly, do NOT generate the plain text format, you must be output the content in JSON structure that had specified above.\n\n",
          "maxIterations": 10
        }
      },
